		(property "Notes" "USB-side bulk with C456 (two KEMET T593V 68 uF 35 V polymer tantalum, 70 mOhm, 1.69 A rms at 85 C, 7343-20, 2.0 mm max, on the 7343 D land pattern; was CCTC CA55 47 uF until 2026-10-31) and four 22u 35V 1210: 133 uF worst case at 20 V (BQ25756 >= 80 uF). Polymer, not MnO2: no ignition on failure, 20 % derating (20 V on 35 V). AC_SNS_N is dead in sleep, so the 0.1 CV leakage rating (238 uA) does not matter here: Production/tools/low_profile_sims.py option C4"
