	(gr_text "KO_NOTE B.Cu (faces the cells, hand-soldered): parts <= 2.3 mm \ntall; up to ~5 mm only in the centre strip x 96-104 or beyond 18mm \nfrom centre. No heat sources on B.Cu. Gap filler zones: solid \ncopper + thermal vias to the power stages. F.Cu: parts <= 3.2 mm \n(cup wall 0.5 mm above)."
